{"id":"sce_ne","lemma":"scène","pos":"noun","rank":531,"glosses":["stage (where performances are held)","location of a play's plot","location, literal or figurative, of any event"],"ipa":"/sɛn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/Fr-sc%C3%A8ne.ogg/Fr-sc%C3%A8ne.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"scènes"},"formAudio":{"scènes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-sc%C3%A8nes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Elle a fait une scène.","en":"She made a scene.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"C'était une scène horrible.","en":"It was a horrible scene.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"horrible"}]},{"text":"J'ai toujours voulu chanter sur scène.","en":"I've always wanted to sing on stage.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to sing"},{"g":"on"},null]},{"text":"Descends simplement de la scène !","en":"Just get off the stage.","words":[{"g":"to go down","l":"descendre"},{"g":"simply"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Il m'a fait chanter sur la scène.","en":"He made me sing on the stage.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"to sing"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}